  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">e-Commerce Development for Latin American Artisans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Although the pandemic made it much worse, most Latin American artisans and especially indigenous artisans have difficult to earn a living wage by selling their crafts. There are two important reasons for this. They often make goods that they like, not the market. Also, their only customers are those that walk by their small storefronts or souvenir shops.  We are asking for your donation to improve our e-commerce store so that anyone can buy their awesome crafts from anywhere.</narrative>
  </description>
